  internalStructure: Mars has a metallic core a silicate mantle and a rocky crust.
    Its core contains iron nickel and lighter elements.
  surfaceAndRings: The surface includes Olympus Mons Valles Marineris polar ice caps
    volcanic plains and impact craters. Mars has no planetary ring system.
  magneticField: Mars does not currently possess a strong global intrinsic magnetic
    field. Localized crustal magnetic regions remain from its ancient magnetic history.
